{
  "_readme": [
    "The prefix table of the crate made. It goes unchanged into the second part of the",
    "@context of crate/ro-crate-metadata.json, right after the URL of the RO-Crate context.",
    "Loaded by helpers/file_handling.py (PROJECT_CONTEXT), path in path_definitions.py.",
    "",
    "The table stands here and not in the Python code, so that a new namespace is a change",
    "of data and not of code - as for every other library.",
    "",
    "WHATEVER IS MISSING HERE STAYS AN UNRESOLVABLE IRI IN THE CRATE. That is silent: the file",
    "stays valid JSON-LD, the entity stays, it only means nothing any more. On 23.09.2026 that",
    "concerned three prefixes (xsd, task, reaction) and was noticed only when the finished",
    "crate was parsed with rdflib. Since then verify_context_completeness checks at the end of",
    "every run whether the table still fits what stands in the crate.",
    "",
    "schema, rdf and rdfs are brought by the RO-Crate 1.3 context as well (with the same IRIs),",
    "but since 27.09.2026 they stand here all the same: helpers/context_links.py reads the",
    "crate with this table alone, without fetching the RO-Crate URL from the net. So every",
    "prefix stands in one place. Words WITHOUT a prefix from the RO-Crate context (about,",
    "conformsTo, dateCreated, ... at the root and the descriptor) are not seen by this step.",
    "The RO-Crate context does not bring xsd, dcterms, owl, time, sosa and qudt.",
    "",
    "The values must agree with the @context of every libraries/*.jsonld AND with",
    "cpo:hasNamespace in ontology_library.jsonld; check_library_consistency.py compares",
    "all three and reports every difference."
  ],

  "@context": {
    "hlo": "http://www.semanticweb.org/lf576/ontologies/2026/7/HigherLevelOntology#",
    "cpo": "http://www.semanticweb.org/lf576/ontologies/2026/7/ChemicalProcessOntology#",

    "schema": "http://schema.org/",
    "rdf": "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#",
    "rdfs": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#",

    "dcterms": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/",
    "xsd": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#",
    "time": "http://www.w3.org/2006/time#",
    "sosa": "http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/",
    "org": "http://www.w3.org/ns/org#",
    "chebi": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/chebi.owl#",
    "qudt": "http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/",
    "quantitykind": "http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/",
    "unit": "http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/",

    "chem": "https://example.org/chemical_entity/",
    "device": "https://example.org/device/",
    "port": "https://example.org/port/",
    "lab": "https://example.org/laboratory/",
    "material": "https://example.org/material/",
    "ontology": "https://example.org/ontology/",
    "organization": "https://example.org/organization/",
    "person": "https://example.org/person/",
    "identifier": "https://example.org/identifier/",
    "site": "https://example.org/site/",
    "energyfield": "https://example.org/energyfield/",
    "environment": "https://example.org/environment/",
    "task": "https://example.org/task/",
    "reaction": "https://example.org/reaction/",
    "software": "https://example.org/software/",
    "placeholder": "https://example.org/placeholder/",
    "document": "https://example.org/document/",

    "crate": "https://example.org/crate/"
  }
}
